Scope note

This licence covers the source code, the glyph normalisation table
(data/variant_map.tsv), the sample input data (samples/) and the documentation
in this repository.

It does **not** cover:

1. the graded character inventory, which is not distributed with this
   repository or with any release asset, in any form. It derives from prior
   work of the research group and is subject to that group's
   intellectual-property position. The software is written to accept any
   inventory supplied in the documented format; supplying one is the user's
   responsibility.

2. the reference corpus files (data/corpus_frozen.csv, data/poems_82_text.csv,
   data/titles_82.tsv), which are likewise not distributed, because their
   per-poem figures are unpublished results of the associated study.
